18	## 3. The two compiled dispatch defects: the measured change on today's tree
19	
20	The fork: whether the 43-line change measured on 2026-09-23 (`explorations/reviews/mie-probes/scope-call-site-dispatch.md` section 3) still holds after climb batch 5's rung Z rewrote parts of `OverloadSet.java`.
